WEBVTT

00:04.540 --> 00:05.500
<b>Oh.</b>

00:05.500 --> 00:08.330
<b>In times of need, call the Hero Club!</b>

00:05.500 --> 00:08.330
<b>We'll save</b>

00:05.500 --> 00:08.330
<b>the world!</b>

00:05.500 --> 00:08.330
<b>We'll save</b>

00:05.500 --> 00:08.330
<b>you, too!</b>

00:05.670 --> 00:07.420
<b>It's a new poster.</b>

00:06.880 --> 00:08.330
<b>Please press for assistance.</b>

00:08.880 --> 00:10.330
<b>Must be Noda-kun's work.</b>

00:11.420 --> 00:13.630
<b>Welcome, customer!</b>

00:13.630 --> 00:18.040
<b>Oh, it's just Pink. I thought someone
was here to ask for help.</b>

00:18.040 --> 00:19.960
<b>What do you mean, "it's just Pink"?!</b>

00:21.540 --> 00:23.630
<b>No requests today either, huh?</b>

00:24.040 --> 00:27.670
<b>Well, if no one needs help, I guess that's a good thing.</b>

00:27.670 --> 00:29.960
<b>Or you could be hiding the job requests.</b>

00:30.500 --> 00:32.040
<b>Stare...</b>

00:32.040 --> 00:33.790
<b>N-no, not anymore!</b>

00:33.790 --> 00:36.790
<b>Some conspiracy must be getting in our way, then.</b>

00:37.130 --> 00:43.250
<b>You mean some organization cast a barrier around
the entire clubroom in fear of my dormant powers?</b>

00:43.790 --> 00:45.250
<b>That's nonsense.</b>

00:45.250 --> 00:46.920
<b>Like that would ever happen.</b>

00:49.460 --> 00:50.540
<b>What?</b>

00:50.750 --> 00:52.710
<b>Green, you're fitting in really well.</b>

00:52.710 --> 00:53.630
<b>Huh?</b>

00:53.750 --> 00:56.420
<b>Well, you come here every day!</b>

00:57.330 --> 01:00.500
<b>Only because you'd pester me if I didn't!</b>

01:01.330 --> 01:06.040
<b>'Cuz you're so busy, huh, Futaba?
For reasons I won't mention here!</b>

01:06.040 --> 01:07.540
<b>Shut up!</b>

01:10.540 --> 01:13.330
<b>Um, this is the Hero Club, right?</b>

01:13.330 --> 01:14.460
<b>That's right!</b>

01:16.830 --> 01:18.250
<b>Please help us!</b>

01:20.670 --> 01:25.210
<b>We need the Hero Club to save us from our crisis!</b>

01:26.170 --> 01:27.420
<b>Sure thing!</b>

01:27.420 --> 01:28.250
<b>Already?!</b>

01:44.330 --> 01:46.710
<b>Sousa ore wa mezamete shimatta</b>

01:46.710 --> 01:49.540
<b>Tokubetsu na chikara motte shimatta</b>

01:49.540 --> 01:51.710
<b>Kono barrier no maeni wa</b>

01:51.710 --> 01:56.170
<b>Donna yatsura mo muryoku daze</b>

01:59.250 --> 02:01.960
<b>Tenshi ka akuma no umarekawari ka</b>

02:01.960 --> 02:04.750
<b>Mienai mono ga miete shimaunda</b>

02:04.750 --> 02:06.960
<b>Migiude ga uzukidashita</b>

02:06.960 --> 02:09.330
<b>Kakusei no toki wa mada hayai</b>

02:09.460 --> 02:12.130
<b>Kodomo janaisi otona demo nai</b>

02:12.130 --> 02:14.460
<b>Tetsugaku pierce buchi akete</b>

02:14.460 --> 02:18.250
<b>Kashiore karaage lemon o kaketara saa!</b>

02:18.540 --> 02:20.830
<b>(Nonde nonde nonde nonde)</b>

02:21.000 --> 02:23.330
<b>Kojirasechatte panpakapappappaan</b>

02:23.330 --> 02:25.920
<b>Kodoku to herikutsu no yami ni magirete</b>

02:25.920 --> 02:28.460
<b>Tokkouyaku wa mitsukaranai</b>

02:28.460 --> 02:30.830
<b>Otoko ni umareta shukumei dakara</b>

02:30.830 --> 02:33.630
<b>Hontou no jibun sagasu tame</b>

02:33.630 --> 02:36.130
<b>Hanate ore no searchlight!</b>

02:36.130 --> 02:38.540
<b>Kojirasechatte panpakapappappaan</b>

02:38.540 --> 02:41.000
<b>Risou to genjitsu no hazama de yureteru</b>

02:41.000 --> 02:43.580
<b>Kaiketsusaku wa miataranai</b>

02:43.580 --> 02:46.130
<b>Setsuna o musaboru unmei naraba</b>

02:46.130 --> 02:48.750
<b>Hontou no jibun sagasu tame</b>

02:48.920 --> 02:51.250
<b>Hanate ore no searchlight!</b>

02:51.250 --> 02:53.830
<b>Eternal Force Blizzard!</b>

02:59.750 --> 03:02.540
<b>Episode 8</b>

02:59.750 --> 03:02.540
<b>Swaying in the Gap Between Ideals and Reality</b>

02:59.790 --> 03:03.710
<b>Our Drama Club is under threat of being disbanded.</b>

03:04.630 --> 03:06.670
<b>Our school has a Drama Club?</b>

03:06.880 --> 03:11.130
<b>It does! Though the only members are the four of us...</b>

03:11.380 --> 03:14.460
<b>You can't play Blasto Rangers with just four people!</b>

03:14.670 --> 03:18.830
<b>We did all we could to try and get more members, but...</b>

03:16.750 --> 03:18.790
<b>Members needed!</b>

03:16.750 --> 03:18.790
<b>(we're desperate)</b>

03:16.750 --> 03:18.790
<b>Drama Club</b>

03:16.750 --> 03:18.790
<b>Come join the Drama Club</b>

03:19.630 --> 03:22.290
<b>Finding new members is tough, all right....</b>

03:23.380 --> 03:25.920
<b>Being on the receiving end is tough too, though.</b>

03:26.580 --> 03:29.960
<b>And clubs needs at least four members to be official.</b>

03:29.960 --> 03:31.460
<b>You barely have enough, then!</b>

03:31.750 --> 03:35.500
<b>And I'm a 3rd year! I have to retire in December!</b>

03:35.500 --> 03:37.460
<b>So we're doomed, pretty much.</b>

03:37.750 --> 03:41.460
<b>Wouldn't it be better to talk to
the Student Council instead of us?</b>

03:41.830 --> 03:44.880
<b>We've already talked to the Student Council, actually...</b>

03:45.420 --> 03:49.250
<b>So here's a skit showing what happened.</b>

03:49.710 --> 03:50.960
<b>"A skit"?</b>

03:52.960 --> 03:56.130
<b>This is the Minakami High School Student Council Room.</b>

03:56.290 --> 04:01.130
<b>Student Council President!
We don't want our Drama Club to get disbanded!</b>

04:01.130 --> 04:03.080
<b>Those are the rules.</b>

04:03.080 --> 04:04.380
<b>Hear, hear!</b>

04:04.750 --> 04:12.000
<b>But why?! The Handbell, Air Guitar, and Shaolin Clubs
all only have three members but they're still going!</b>

04:13.040 --> 04:19.880
<b>They have proved themselves before! Club funds
are limited! We must get rid of what's unnecessary!</b>

04:20.380 --> 04:24.000
<b>How hard a club tries is more important!</b>

04:24.000 --> 04:31.580
<b>Then prove your efforts. If you get first place
in the popularity poll at the upcoming cultural festival,</b>

04:27.130 --> 04:28.460
<b>Minakami High School</b>

04:27.130 --> 04:28.460
<b>Cultural Festival</b>

04:29.040 --> 04:34.880
<b>Cultural Festival</b>

04:29.040 --> 04:34.880
<b>Popularity Poll!</b>

04:31.580 --> 04:34.920
<b>we shall put off disbanding the Drama Club!</b>

04:36.830 --> 04:39.420
<b>All right! First place, it is!</b>

04:42.290 --> 04:47.420
<b>Thus, the Drama Club President made
a ridiculous deal with the Student Council.</b>

04:47.750 --> 04:51.830
<b>She was about to head back to
the clubroom in despair, when...!</b>

04:53.330 --> 04:54.540
<b>This is it!</b>

04:55.000 --> 04:58.170
<b>The Hero Club will save the Drama Club!</b>

04:59.960 --> 05:01.420
<b>So that's what happened.</b>

05:03.290 --> 05:06.330
<b>I think... I understand the gist of it...</b>

05:06.630 --> 05:08.710
<b>So the Drama Club needs to place first?</b>

05:08.880 --> 05:10.080
<b>Got it!</b>

05:10.330 --> 05:13.040
<b>Um, isn't that pretty much impossible?</b>

05:13.750 --> 05:18.290
<b>Come on, help us out! Please act on stage
with us at the cultural festival!</b>

05:18.290 --> 05:19.710
<b>Please!</b>

05:20.670 --> 05:25.580
<b>Leave it to us! We willingly take on
any mission we get. That's the Hero Club!</b>

05:26.580 --> 05:28.080
<b>Thank you so much!</b>

05:28.500 --> 05:31.170
<b>What with the different types of good-looking guys</b>

05:31.170 --> 05:35.080
<b>and the buzz you're getting,
having the Hero Club help us is really reassuring!</b>

05:35.080 --> 05:37.580
<b>We have no experience acting, though.</b>

05:37.580 --> 05:42.540
<b>No problem! You have the flair to captivate the audience!</b>

05:42.540 --> 05:44.830
<b>That's right, you have the aura of true stars!</b>

05:45.580 --> 05:51.580
<b>Well yeah, it might be harder for you
to find someone better looking than me, huh?</b>

05:52.000 --> 05:56.670
<b>No matter how I conceal myself in darkness,
history always drags me out into the spotlight.</b>

05:56.670 --> 05:59.540
<b>I suppose its the fate of one who wields power...</b>

06:01.040 --> 06:05.960
<b>I'm used to deceiving people.
I'm sure I can play any kind of part.</b>

06:08.000 --> 06:12.830
<b>All right! The entire Hero Club's gonna
help out the Drama Club!</b>

06:13.040 --> 06:14.500
<b>Yeah!</b>

06:14.500 --> 06:16.460
<b>Thank you so much!</b>

06:19.960 --> 06:24.000
<b>Right, these are the parts I want you to play.</b>

06:20.880 --> 06:23.960
<b>Thumbelina... Yamato Noda</b>

06:20.880 --> 06:23.960
<b>Snow White... Tomoki Takashima</b>

06:20.880 --> 06:23.960
<b>Cinderella... Toga Ryushoin</b>

06:20.880 --> 06:23.960
<b>Sleeping Beauty... Futaba Mikuriya</b>

06:20.880 --> 06:23.960
<b>Prince's horse... Rei Tsukumo</b>

06:20.880 --> 06:23.960
<b>Prince... Yui Saito</b>

06:20.880 --> 06:23.960
<b>Witch... Misaki Shimokawa</b>

06:24.000 --> 06:26.000
<b>I'm Thumbelina, huh?!</b>

06:24.000 --> 06:26.460
<b>Thumbelina</b>

06:26.250 --> 06:29.000
<b>I'll use a bowl as a boat and go defeat some ogres!</b>

06:26.250 --> 06:29.000
<b>Note: He means the Japanese folktale Issun-boshi, not Thumbelina.</b>

06:29.210 --> 06:34.040
<b>I'm the fairest... no, second fairest one of all, Snow White!</b>

06:31.210 --> 06:34.420
<b>Snow White</b>

06:34.290 --> 06:36.790
<b>The fairest, of course... is Sora-chan!</b>

06:37.000 --> 06:39.790
<b>My name is the cinder-covered Cinderella...</b>

06:39.790 --> 06:45.920
<b>the anti-heroine on a journey to destroy
her wicked stepfamily who reappeared in this life!</b>

06:40.460 --> 06:45.880
<b>Cinderella</b>

06:46.290 --> 06:52.460
<b>We'll fix the misinterpretations later,
but I'm just glad you're all happy with your roles!</b>

06:53.880 --> 06:55.750
<b>I'm sorry, but I'm not doing this.</b>

06:55.750 --> 06:59.000
<b>But the whole Hero Club is supposed to cooperate.</b>

07:00.000 --> 07:03.210
<b>I'll cooperate, but I have no intention of getting on stage.</b>

07:03.710 --> 07:05.580
<b>You want to work backstage?</b>

07:05.580 --> 07:07.960
<b>That's such a waste of your good looks, though.</b>

07:09.460 --> 07:12.290
<b>I have my own policies.</b>

07:14.080 --> 07:17.710
<b>All right. I'll cut Sleeping Beauty out.</b>

07:18.170 --> 07:21.420
<b>Hmm? Even then, we still have three main princesses.</b>

07:21.670 --> 07:23.710
<b>What's the plot going to be like?</b>

07:24.330 --> 07:26.210
<b>I thought you'd never ask!</b>

07:26.580 --> 07:28.580
<b>Main characters from fairy tales</b>

07:26.580 --> 07:28.580
<b>•Cinderella</b>

07:26.580 --> 07:28.580
<b>•Snow White                   Team up!    Defeat the enemy!</b>

07:26.590 --> 07:28.580
<b>•Sleeping Beauty                                     (witch)</b>

07:26.590 --> 07:28.580
<b>•Thumbelina</b>

07:26.590 --> 07:28.580
<b>(Reverse thinking)</b>

07:26.590 --> 07:28.580
<b>The princess saves the prince</b>

07:26.630 --> 07:33.830
<b>A bunch of princesses from different fairy tales work
together to save a prince kidnapped by a witch!</b>

07:31.500 --> 07:36.290
<b>Princess Rhapsodies</b>

07:31.500 --> 07:36.290
<b>A Fairy Tale Turned Upside Down</b>

07:33.830 --> 07:35.210
<b>Ooh!</b>

07:36.920 --> 07:37.540
<b>Huh?</b>

07:37.540 --> 07:38.830
<b>Um, can I say something?</b>

07:39.420 --> 07:42.420
<b>Nothing big... just a simple mistake.</b>

07:42.790 --> 07:43.830
<b>This here.</b>

07:44.040 --> 07:50.790
<b>Prince's horse</b>

07:45.080 --> 07:50.170
<b>It says "Prince's horse," when it's supposed
to be "Prince on horseback"...</b>

07:51.130 --> 07:53.420
<b>No, that's correct.</b>

07:54.420 --> 07:56.170
<b>The horse is a huge role!</b>

07:56.500 --> 07:57.830
<b>"H-huge"?</b>

07:58.130 --> 08:02.500
<b>You know how they say "God is in the detail,"
nay, "in the horse"?</b>

08:02.960 --> 08:08.460
<b>The horse, the ultimate minor character, is
the true lead who decides the fate of this production!</b>

08:08.460 --> 08:10.630
<b>"The true lead"...?</b>

08:10.790 --> 08:16.380
<b>That's right! Whether this play succeeds or
not depends on your horse, Tsukumo-kun.</b>

08:16.380 --> 08:19.000
<b>Plus the saying "break a leg" also refers to a horse!</b>

08:19.460 --> 08:23.750
<b>Ha. You cast me as a horse, huh? You...</b>

08:24.670 --> 08:26.830
<b>...have a pretty good eye!</b>

08:27.170 --> 08:29.380
<b>Thanks! I have high hopes for you!</b>

08:29.880 --> 08:32.710
<b>Tsukumo-kun, she's manipulating you...</b>

08:33.250 --> 08:36.920
<b>Right then, let's practice
some basics out on the schoolyard.</b>

08:36.920 --> 08:39.920
<b>I'm gonna push you all hard, so try to keep up!</b>

08:39.920 --> 08:40.790
<b>Right!</b>

08:44.830 --> 08:48.630
<b>I'm Okabe, in charge of backstage stuff.
Can you come with me?</b>

08:48.630 --> 08:50.670
<b>Oh, sure! Coming.</b>

08:50.670 --> 08:51.880
<b>Come on, focus!</b>

08:51.880 --> 08:53.670
<b>For maximum efficiency for the basics,</b>

08:53.920 --> 08:57.540
<b>we'll do a combination drill of tongue twisters
and vocal exercises.</b>

08:57.920 --> 09:00.500
<b>First, let's hear you enunciate in loud voices!</b>

09:00.500 --> 09:01.630
<b>You start off, Noda-kun.</b>

09:01.630 --> 09:02.540
<b>Okay!</b>

09:02.830 --> 09:04.790
<b>Red ninja, blue ninja, yellow ninja!</b>

09:04.790 --> 09:06.790
<b>Conspire, aspire, vampire!</b>

09:06.790 --> 09:08.790
<b>Destroy Mirage Catastrophe Death Attack!</b>

09:08.790 --> 09:10.540
<b>Love love I love iLive!</b>

09:10.670 --> 09:12.080
<b>Faster!</b>

09:15.210 --> 09:18.790
<b>Now keep up those tongue twisters
and run laps around the schoolyard!</b>

09:19.080 --> 09:19.920
<b>Uh...?</b>

09:20.210 --> 09:23.630
<b>It'll train your enunciation and
abdominal breathing, as well as your stamina!</b>

09:23.630 --> 09:25.380
<b>It's the ultimate way to train!</b>

09:25.670 --> 09:30.830
<b>That goes beyond the capacity of this delicate temporary
vessel bestowed upon my current mortal incarnation!</b>

09:30.830 --> 09:32.210
<b>You can do it!</b>

09:32.210 --> 09:34.750
<b>Unless you can prove that, I shan't run!</b>

09:35.000 --> 09:37.830
<b>You really hate running, huh?</b>

09:38.130 --> 09:41.830
<b>You want me to show how it's done? That's fine with me.</b>

09:42.080 --> 09:45.710
<b>Here's the Drama Club President's
super ultimate serious mode!</b>

09:46.540 --> 09:48.330
<b>Just you watch!</b>

09:50.830 --> 09:53.790
<b>Note: She's reciting a ridiculously long name</b>

09:50.830 --> 09:53.790
<b>that appears in rakugo comedy.</b>

09:50.840 --> 09:53.830
<b>Jugemu Jugemu Goko-no-Surikire Kaijari-suigyo no
Suigyo-matsu Furai-matsu...</b>

09:54.290 --> 09:55.500
<b>She's really doing it.</b>

09:55.500 --> 09:57.500
<b>I've been foiled!</b>

09:57.500 --> 09:59.580
<b>Her legs are moving crazy fast.</b>

09:59.580 --> 10:00.960
<b>Awesome!</b>

10:04.420 --> 10:06.250
<b>Now, let's see you do it.</b>

10:06.710 --> 10:07.670
<b>Okay!</b>

10:06.960 --> 10:08.000
<b>Okay...</b>

10:10.170 --> 10:11.170
<b>Whew...</b>

10:11.170 --> 10:15.290
<b>Red ninja, blue ninja, yellow ninja! 
</b><b>Destroy Mirage Catastrophe Death Attack!</b><b>
Conspire, aspire, vampire! Conspire, aspire, vampire!
</b><b>Love love I love iLive!</b><b></b>

10:15.290 --> 10:16.630
<b>They're trying hard.</b>

10:17.580 --> 10:23.460
<b>Yeah. Pretending you're someone else
is the same thing as deceiving yourself.</b>

10:24.500 --> 10:25.580
<b>Huh?</b>

10:27.580 --> 10:29.330
<b>Mikuriya...kun?</b>

10:30.630 --> 10:33.630
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys!
Outburst Dreamer Boys! Outburst Dreamer-!</b>

10:35.250 --> 10:36.920
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys.</b>

10:37.580 --> 10:39.290
<b>Drama Club</b>

10:37.580 --> 10:39.290
<b>rehearsing now</b>

10:39.540 --> 10:41.130
<b>"My name is Snow White."</b>

10:41.130 --> 10:46.380
<b>"One day, an evil witch fed me a poisoned apple
and now I'm in critical condition!"</b>

10:46.380 --> 10:47.880
<b>Not bad.</b>

10:47.880 --> 10:52.710
<b>"What's going on with...m-my l...l-l-"</b>

10:53.830 --> 10:56.250
<b>Love love I love iLive!</b>

10:56.250 --> 10:57.630
<b>Memorize it properly!</b>

10:59.580 --> 11:02.920
<b>"My name is Cinderella.
The prince who gave me a glass slipper-"</b>

11:02.920 --> 11:04.710
<b>And this dude's Thumbelina!</b>

11:04.710 --> 11:06.290
<b>Cut!</b>

11:06.540 --> 11:10.380
<b>Too early, Noda-kun! And you're not a guy, you're a girl!</b>

11:10.830 --> 11:16.880
<b>"The same witch might be behind all this.
Little lady, care to tell us your name?"</b>

11:17.290 --> 11:20.710
<b>This dude's...! Uh, "I'm Thumbelina!"</b>

11:20.710 --> 11:24.460
<b>Uh..."A toad"...and, erm...</b>

11:24.460 --> 11:29.380
<b>"...a doodlebug, and a mole all tried
to make me their bride..."</b>

11:29.380 --> 11:30.880
<b>A doodlebug...and a molra...!</b>

11:30.880 --> 11:33.040
<b>Not "molra," "mole"!</b>

11:34.420 --> 11:37.710
<b>"Molra" sounds like an Ulftra monster, Yamato!</b>

11:37.710 --> 11:40.170
<b>It just comes out like that!</b>

11:40.880 --> 11:42.630
<b>That's the end of the first act.</b>

11:42.630 --> 11:43.630
<b>Molwah!</b>

11:44.790 --> 11:50.500
<b>Next in the second act, Cinderella gets attacked by
a monster in the forest, so act frightened and run!</b>

11:45.210 --> 11:47.210
<b>Why can't I say it right...?</b>

11:47.210 --> 11:48.710
<b>Let's just keep trying, 'kay?</b>

11:52.040 --> 11:53.540
<b>How ironic.</b>

11:53.540 --> 12:00.460
<b>I already wear a mask to act human, and now
I must don a second mask to become Cinderella.</b>

12:00.460 --> 12:02.710
<b>Nakamura-kun? Ready to begin?</b>

12:03.130 --> 12:06.130
<b>Sure. Let's get started.</b>

12:06.420 --> 12:08.000
<b>Monster</b>

12:06.630 --> 12:07.500
<b>And, action!</b>

12:07.630 --> 12:09.540
<b>Roar!</b>

12:09.540 --> 12:10.330
<b>Hah!</b>

12:11.630 --> 12:16.580
<b>Imbecile! Did you really think an attack
like that could defeat me?!</b>

12:16.960 --> 12:21.040
<b>Princess Rhapsodies</b>

12:16.960 --> 12:21.040
<b>A Fairy Tale Turned Upside Down</b>

12:16.960 --> 12:21.040
<b>The Holy Black Knight's Book of Sorcery</b>

12:18.250 --> 12:21.080
<b>O jet black winds that race over scorched earth...</b>

12:21.080 --> 12:24.460
<b>O torrential hand that exterminates all...</b>

12:24.710 --> 12:28.710
<b>Answer my call in accordance with our ancient pact!</b>

12:30.500 --> 12:31.960
<b>Dark Cross...</b>

12:32.920 --> 12:35.170
<b>Tornado!</b>

12:35.830 --> 12:37.630
<b>Cut! Cut! And, cut!</b>

12:37.630 --> 12:41.330
<b>Why would the feeble Cinderella
use some kind of dark magic?!</b>

12:41.330 --> 12:46.710
<b>I apologize. Seeing the dragon stirred
the blood of the Black Night within me.</b>

12:47.000 --> 12:47.920
<b>Ha!</b>

12:48.630 --> 12:51.170
<b>This is why amateurs are no good!</b>

12:52.080 --> 12:55.080
<b>You. What about your part as a horse?</b>

12:55.580 --> 12:59.500
<b>This is part of preparing for it.
Right now, I'm out on the pasture.</b>

12:59.500 --> 13:01.080
<b>Excuse me.</b>

13:01.500 --> 13:03.210
<b>Oh hey, Tsukumo-kun.</b>

13:03.790 --> 13:07.750
<b>I'm sorry, but could you help us make the scenery?</b>

13:08.380 --> 13:12.540
<b>Okay fine, I'll lend you a hand... No, I'll lend you a hoof!</b>

13:12.540 --> 13:14.000
<b>He's totally into his part...</b>

13:14.630 --> 13:15.920
<b>Neigh!</b>

13:16.330 --> 13:17.500
<b>Such a pain!</b>

13:19.880 --> 13:21.500
<b>So what are you making?</b>

13:23.130 --> 13:24.630
<b>The foundation for the scenery.</b>

13:24.630 --> 13:26.960
<b>You're so good with your hands, Mikuriya-kun!</b>

13:26.960 --> 13:28.330
<b>You're like a professional!</b>

13:28.750 --> 13:31.960
<b>Rei, have you finished the head of the horse?</b>

13:32.250 --> 13:35.460
<b>If you're that desperate to see it, just say so!</b>

13:39.130 --> 13:41.040
<b>What... is that?</b>

13:41.040 --> 13:46.170
<b>I gave the horse a "cheetah" pattern to show
that it's so fast, it's "cheating."</b>

13:46.170 --> 13:48.130
<b>15 more days</b>

13:46.170 --> 13:48.130
<b>until the cultural festival!</b>

13:46.460 --> 13:48.170
<b>Ready and, action!</b>

13:48.330 --> 13:50.040
<b>"I'm Thumbelina!"</b>

13:50.290 --> 13:53.580
<b>"A toad, a doodlebug, and a molra-!"</b>

13:53.580 --> 13:56.670
<b>No, I mean "mola"...! No, "mole"!</b>

13:56.670 --> 13:57.920
<b>Cut!</b>

13:58.670 --> 14:03.290
<b>"I heard a rumor that the prince was kidnapped
by a witch, so I'm on my way to rescue-"</b>

14:03.290 --> 14:05.080
<b>"I'm Thumbelina!"</b>

14:05.210 --> 14:06.250
<b>Too early!</b>

14:06.830 --> 14:09.420
<b>"A toad, a doodlebug, and a molila-!"</b>

14:09.420 --> 14:11.380
<b>It's...a..."mole"!</b>

14:11.830 --> 14:13.790
<b>"I'm a toad!"</b>

14:14.080 --> 14:14.880
<b>Oops...</b>

14:15.330 --> 14:16.330
<b><i>Non!</i></b>

14:17.380 --> 14:18.630
<b>Check this out, Futaba!</b>

14:19.330 --> 14:21.630
<b>I finished the new horse's head!</b>

14:23.380 --> 14:24.920
<b>Are you serious?</b>

14:26.170 --> 14:27.130
<b>"Ashiri"...?</b>

14:27.710 --> 14:30.170
<b>Broadcast Studio</b>

14:27.880 --> 14:31.130
<b>This is the Student Broadcast
Committee Chair, Yoshizumi-senpai.</b>

14:31.130 --> 14:34.830
<b>He'll be helping us make the background music
and sound effects for the play.</b>

14:36.540 --> 14:38.580
<b>Let's play "Precious Memories" here!</b>

14:38.960 --> 14:43.960
<b>You play lots of Vocaloid songs during
the lunch hour broadcast. I like a lot of those.</b>

14:44.170 --> 14:47.580
<b>Aw, thanks! Oh, then do you like Kirito Setsuna?</b>

14:47.960 --> 14:50.420
<b>"Kirito Setsuna"?</b>

14:50.670 --> 14:53.790
<b>He's an online singer, and I'm really into him right now.</b>

14:54.170 --> 14:56.630
<b>Huh! I'll check him out when I get home.</b>

14:56.920 --> 14:59.380
<b>You really should. It's pretty awesome.</b>

14:59.380 --> 15:03.540
<b>But you know, he hasn't uploaded anything for a while.</b>

15:03.830 --> 15:10.000
<b>Some say he's quit, or got married, or ran away
...or that he might even be performing offline now.</b>

15:10.420 --> 15:12.710
<b>You think the fame got to his head?</b>

15:13.130 --> 15:13.880
<b>H...</b>

15:14.080 --> 15:17.790
<b>He probably got into his club activities
so much he forgot to upload stuff!</b>

15:17.790 --> 15:21.750
<b>What? Kirito's a student? How do you know that?</b>

15:22.040 --> 15:26.460
<b>Yeah, I'm surprised. I didn't think you'd watch
nicorico videos, Mikuriya-kun.</b>

15:22.040 --> 15:26.420
<b>Note: nicorico is a parody of a certain video-sharing service</b>

15:26.670 --> 15:30.880
<b>E-enough with the chitchat. Let's get this over with.</b>

15:31.130 --> 15:33.710
<b>Mikuriya-kun never gets flustered like this...</b>

15:38.170 --> 15:42.130
<b>Kirito Setsuna</b>

15:38.330 --> 15:41.000
<b>Kirito... Kirito...</b>

15:42.460 --> 15:44.080
<b>Oh, is this it?</b>

15:45.000 --> 15:47.750
<b>Hmm? You're too excited to sleep?</b>

15:48.710 --> 15:53.790
<b>Fine, then... tonight, I'll give you
some sweet and wistful dreams.</b>

15:55.630 --> 15:58.670
<b>Your wet eyes are full of sorrow</b>

15:57.670 --> 15:59.920
<b>Uh...this...</b>

15:58.670 --> 16:03.000
<b>I'll catch the drops that overflow for you</b>

16:00.380 --> 16:05.250
<b>It's devastatingly off-key...
and the arrangement is... unique, I guess...</b>

16:03.000 --> 16:07.210
<b>Now go ahead and drown in your tears</b>

16:05.250 --> 16:07.210
<b>No, I think the word is "tone-deaf"...</b>

16:07.460 --> 16:12.670
<b>Applying rouge again because you can't get enough?</b>

16:07.920 --> 16:10.830
<b>But it's surprisingly catchy...</b>

16:11.170 --> 16:14.290
<b>Huh?! This guy... He looks just like Mikuriya-kun!</b>

16:12.670 --> 16:17.290
<b>Forget it, these lips are going to remove it, anyway</b>

16:14.290 --> 16:16.460
<b>Nothing's impossible when you have real charisma.</b>

16:16.460 --> 16:20.630
<b>Okay! Tonight, I'll go steal you away in your dreams.</b>

16:20.630 --> 16:22.290
<b>You'd better be ready.</b>

16:22.290 --> 16:23.710
<b>My... love!</b>

16:26.500 --> 16:27.540
<b>That's nonsense.</b>

16:27.830 --> 16:31.960
<b>His face is similar, but I guess there's no way
the cool and good-looking Mikuriya-kun</b>

16:31.960 --> 16:36.290
<b>would upload a performance like this
just to play to the crowd...</b>

16:36.630 --> 16:38.830
<b>But... they're so similar!</b>

16:40.210 --> 16:41.920
<b>7 more days</b>

16:40.210 --> 16:41.920
<b>until the cultural festival!</b>

16:41.130 --> 16:45.830
<b>I'm Thumbelina! A toad, a doodlebug, and a mole!</b>

16:46.290 --> 16:50.500
<b>They all tried to make me their bride,
but I rode on a swallow!</b>

16:50.790 --> 16:55.330
<b>A flower kingdom...! A prince...! And...</b>

16:56.210 --> 16:57.000
<b>Yamato!</b>

16:57.000 --> 16:58.330
<b>N..Noda-kun?!</b>

16:58.330 --> 16:59.420
<b>Is he okay?!</b>

17:00.580 --> 17:02.250
<b>He has a crazy fever.</b>

17:02.250 --> 17:06.380
<b>Hey Prez... I said..."mole" properly...!</b>

17:06.380 --> 17:07.460
<b>Noda-kun!</b>

17:07.460 --> 17:08.250
<b>Yamato!</b>

17:10.630 --> 17:12.460
<b>Looks like his fever's down now.</b>

17:12.460 --> 17:15.710
<b>Yamato hasn't been getting enough
sleep the past few days.</b>

17:16.040 --> 17:17.920
<b>Probably 'cuz he was doing stuff he's not used to.</b>

17:17.920 --> 17:19.420
<b>His brain must have overheated.</b>

17:20.040 --> 17:21.500
<b>Is this Noda-kun's script?</b>

17:21.500 --> 17:25.210
<b>Mole</b>

17:21.500 --> 17:25.210
<b>Mole</b>

17:21.500 --> 17:25.210
<b>Mole</b>

17:22.000 --> 17:26.080
<b>Look at this... And I drove him to it...</b>

17:26.880 --> 17:28.500
<b>I feel so bad.</b>

17:28.830 --> 17:30.670
<b>It's not your fault.</b>

17:30.670 --> 17:34.540
<b>Nobody gets a fever having
to memorize just a few of lines.</b>

17:34.960 --> 17:37.330
<b>Does he just not use his brain enough normally?</b>

17:37.330 --> 17:39.500
<b>No, that's not true.</b>

17:40.080 --> 17:41.000
<b>For example...</b>

17:41.670 --> 17:43.960
<b>Ulftraman dictionary, activate!</b>

17:46.170 --> 17:51.750
<b>Ulftraman. 30 meters tall and
weighs 3.14159265359 metric tons.</b>

17:52.000 --> 17:53.250
<b>What's happening?!</b>

17:53.250 --> 17:55.250
<b>Flies at a speed of Mach 666.</b>

17:55.250 --> 17:56.790
<b>The number of the beast...</b>

17:57.170 --> 17:59.250
<b>Huh?! What was I doing?</b>

17:59.250 --> 18:03.540
<b>Yamato has an uncanny memory
when it comes to his interests.</b>

18:03.670 --> 18:07.290
<b>No matter how suddenly I give him the cue,
he can recite that without making one mistake.</b>

18:07.290 --> 18:08.420
<b>Wow...</b>

18:08.420 --> 18:11.130
<b>Ah... I see.</b>

18:11.830 --> 18:13.330
<b>Okay, I've got it!</b>

18:13.540 --> 18:18.250
<b>Noda-kun, starting now, you have the power
to knock out evil using just your thumb!</b>

18:18.670 --> 18:20.630
<b>A powerful Thumbelina!</b>

18:20.630 --> 18:21.380
<b>Huh?!</b>

18:21.380 --> 18:22.880
<b>What do you mean?!</b>

18:23.460 --> 18:28.460
<b>Forget about forcing yourself to memorize lines!
Just be your usual self, Noda-kun.</b>

18:28.750 --> 18:31.210
<b>Will the play really work like that?</b>

18:31.210 --> 18:32.460
<b>No problem!</b>

18:32.460 --> 18:37.250
<b>We'll cover Noda-kun's lack of lines
by having everyone else adlib.</b>

18:37.250 --> 18:40.000
<b>That way, each of you can shine in your own way.</b>

18:40.380 --> 18:41.790
<b>That sounds interesting!</b>

18:41.790 --> 18:43.750
<b>It'll be fun as an improv piece, too.</b>

18:43.750 --> 18:47.420
<b>That Thumbelina... I want to do it!</b>

18:47.790 --> 18:50.250
<b>Me, too. It sounds like fun.</b>

18:50.580 --> 18:51.580
<b>Mm-hm!</b>

18:51.920 --> 18:56.920
<b>Making appropriate adjustments
on the fly is a breeze for Toga Ryushoin.</b>

18:56.920 --> 19:02.040
<b>Hey. That's a big problem for me,
'cuz I did a perfect job of preparing for my part!</b>

19:02.040 --> 19:06.250
<b>But you're such a charismatic actor, Tsukumo-kun.
Adlibbing must be a cinch for you!</b>

19:06.580 --> 19:12.830
<b>W-well, yeah. Just you watch,
I'll make the whole world cry...</b>

19:13.500 --> 19:15.380
<b>with my "prince's horse"!</b>

19:15.500 --> 19:16.880
<b>Neeigh!</b>

19:19.540 --> 19:25.210
<b>Well, I think it's best if you guys don't
have to deceive yourselves.</b>

19:26.500 --> 19:27.960
<b>Mikuriya-kun...?</b>

19:28.330 --> 19:31.750
<b>Yup! This is definitely going to be a fun show!</b>

19:32.330 --> 19:37.750
<b>Everyone! Let's get ready and
rehearse as a team, and enjoy this!</b>

19:38.130 --> 19:39.830
<b>4 more days</b>

19:38.130 --> 19:39.830
<b>until the cultural festival!</b>

19:50.170 --> 19:51.420
<b>2 more days</b>

19:50.170 --> 19:51.420
<b>until the cultural festival!</b>

19:51.420 --> 19:53.630
<b>1 more day</b>

19:51.420 --> 19:53.630
<b>until the cultural festival!</b>

19:53.880 --> 19:55.670
<b>We've got a problem!</b>

19:56.250 --> 19:57.500
<b>The scenery!</b>

20:00.960 --> 20:03.830
<b>It's covered in paw prints...
How could this have happened...?</b>

20:03.830 --> 20:05.170
<b>That hole in the window...</b>

20:05.670 --> 20:09.630
<b>Probably a midnight meeting of cats turned into a frenzy.</b>

20:10.960 --> 20:15.080
<b>I-it wasn't our Benjamin! That cat was sleeping by my
side all night!</b>

20:15.380 --> 20:18.960
<b>It wasn't Faust, either! I had him in bed
with me last night, like always!</b>

20:19.380 --> 20:21.290
<b>Faust is a parakeet.</b>

20:21.290 --> 20:23.630
<b>Wait, you sleep with him?!</b>

20:24.000 --> 20:26.670
<b>The time has come... The time has come...</b>

20:27.080 --> 20:28.670
<b>We worked so hard...</b>

20:31.170 --> 20:32.960
<b>No point crying over it!</b>

20:34.290 --> 20:37.210
<b>Noda, is the signboard from Sports Day still around?</b>

20:37.460 --> 20:41.330
<b>I think that's in gym storage over... Oh!</b>

20:44.630 --> 20:47.330
<b>A hero's got to overcome obstacles, right?</b>

20:49.750 --> 20:53.330
<b>Yup! Overcoming all odds is what makes a hero!</b>

20:53.670 --> 20:57.130
<b>This kind of obstacle is well within my expectations.</b>

20:57.130 --> 21:02.250
<b>Use my glue and poster paper. It's left over from
making the horse, anyway. Go right ahead.</b>

21:02.250 --> 21:06.080
<b>I'll go hit up my friends in
the Manga and Art Clubs for paint.</b>

21:08.960 --> 21:10.960
<b>It was much too early to give up.</b>

21:11.380 --> 21:15.710
<b>All right! Let's all work together
to get through this emergency!</b>

21:15.710 --> 21:17.000
<b>Yeah!</b>

21:29.250 --> 21:30.290
<b>It's done!</b>

21:30.540 --> 21:32.330
<b>Yes!</b>

21:32.630 --> 21:35.580
<b>Stray cats keep out!</b>

21:40.330 --> 21:42.540
<b>I'm so glad things worked out.</b>

21:42.540 --> 21:45.960
<b>I know! I thought we were doomed for a while there.</b>

21:46.460 --> 21:47.500
<b>Green!</b>

21:49.000 --> 21:50.580
<b>Green, thanks!</b>

21:52.000 --> 21:55.790
<b>We got out of this emergency, all thanks to you!</b>

21:57.170 --> 22:01.000
<b>Hmph! Nothing's impossible
when you have real charisma.</b>

22:01.670 --> 22:06.960
<b>Huh? Didn't Kirito Setsuna say those exact words...?</b>

22:04.130 --> 22:08.790
<b>Azayaka na melody kisetsu no kaze o matoi</b>

22:07.460 --> 22:10.210
<b>Futaba, your face is all red!</b>

22:08.790 --> 22:11.880
<b>Boku o yonderu</b>

22:10.420 --> 22:12.040
<b>Well, look at you.</b>

22:12.130 --> 22:19.330
<b>Afuredasu rhythm kutsuoto mo kasoku shite</b>

22:14.330 --> 22:15.380
<b>You're all white.</b>

22:15.460 --> 22:16.540
<b>Since when?!</b>

22:19.210 --> 22:20.790
<b>You're White Purple now!</b>

22:19.750 --> 22:27.580
<b>Utsumuiteru dakeja tsukamenai nanika sagashi ni yukou</b>

22:22.080 --> 22:26.080
<b>Please let tomorrow's cultural festival
succeed without any issues!</b>

22:27.750 --> 22:37.830
<b>Donna takai kabe demo kimi to yukunara kitto toberu sa</b>

22:38.250 --> 22:40.540
<b>Let's get started! All right?</b>

22:40.880 --> 22:44.790
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

22:44.790 --> 22:48.000
<b>Egaita sono tsubasa de</b>

22:48.000 --> 22:51.790
<b>Keep flying and to story</b>

22:52.040 --> 22:56.670
<b>Ashita o kakeru kara</b>

22:56.670 --> 23:00.790
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

23:00.790 --> 23:04.130
<b>Kienai sono kodou wa</b>

23:04.130 --> 23:08.040
<b>Keep trying and to story</b>

23:08.040 --> 23:11.710
<b>Kasanaru harmony</b>

23:11.880 --> 23:17.500
<b>Dare no mono demonai miraizu wa</b>

23:17.880 --> 23:22.880
<b>Kimi to tsuzutteku</b>

23:26.830 --> 23:28.880
<b>What music should we play during the cultural festival?</b>

23:27.830 --> 23:30.330
<b>Finally, it's the cultural festival</b>

23:28.330 --> 23:30.750
<b>I don't care about the festival...</b>

23:28.880 --> 23:29.790
<b>Blasto Rangers!</b>

23:29.420 --> 23:32.580
<b>You're gonna play a hero song at the festival?!</b>

23:29.790 --> 23:32.790
<b>Why about the finest song iLive has
to offer, "Precious Memories"?</b>

23:29.830 --> 23:30.580
<b>Blasto Rangers!!!</b>

23:30.710 --> 23:32.670
<b>Heroes never fear anything!</b>

23:32.580 --> 23:34.210
<b>Sora-chan is my #1 divine idol</b>

23:32.710 --> 23:36.330
<b>The iLiver costume is so intense it looks like it's for a ritual</b>

23:32.750 --> 23:34.130
<b>PreMemo for the win</b>

23:32.790 --> 23:34.130
<b>Wait, we got something.</b>

23:32.790 --> 23:33.540
<b>Total geek</b>

23:33.000 --> 23:34.460
<b>No, I just cant. So precious.</b>

23:33.500 --> 23:34.330
<b>Death by preciousness</b>

23:34.130 --> 23:35.080
<b>A request?</b>

23:35.080 --> 23:36.790
<b>Let's see... Unu...chanchan...</b>

23:36.790 --> 23:37.880
<b>That's "Kirito Setsuna."</b>

23:38.080 --> 23:39.290
<b>Kirito</b>

23:38.170 --> 23:40.290
<b>Next episode: "The Number You're Trying to Reach."</b>

23:38.420 --> 23:40.420
<b>Comments are now in extreme otaku territory</b>

23:38.460 --> 23:39.750
<b>God</b>

23:38.540 --> 23:39.420
<b>So my fave</b>

23:38.790 --> 23:41.040
<b>Kirito            Kirito           Kirito           Kirito</b>

23:39.040 --> 23:40.500
<b>In actual love with my fave</b>

23:39.420 --> 23:41.040
<b>God                God               God              God</b>

23:39.630 --> 23:41.040
<b>Kirito's seriously my fave</b>
